ror cabinet (frames 16, 21, 23, 26) but does not apply any visible cosmetic products.\n\n---\n\n### **6. Does she do laundry?**\n❌ **No.**  \nAlthough a washing machine/dryer is visible in the background, **she does not interact with it** in any of the 30 frames. No opening of the machine, loading clothes, or pressing buttons is observed.\n\n---\n\n### **Evaluation of Answer Choice '1':**\n> **“Wash her face, brush her teeth, and comb her hair”**\n\n- ✅ Brushing teeth — **CONFIRMED**\n- ✅ Combing/brushing hair — **CONFIRMED**\n- ❌ Washing face — **NOT CONFIRMED**\n\nSince **washing her face is not visually confirmed**, and the answer choice **requires all three actions to be present**, the answer **'1' is NOT fully correct**.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ **Final Verdict: INCORRECT**\n\nThe answer choice **'1' is invalid** because it includes “wash her face,” which is **not demonstrably performed** in the provided frames. While brushing teeth and combing hair are confirmed, the inclusion of face washing — which is not verified — makes the entire answer inaccurate per the strict criteria.\n\n---\n\n**Note:** If the question allowed partial credit or excluded unconfirmed actions, this might be acceptable. But since the answer choice is a fixed triplet and the criteria demand verification of each component, **'1' fails**."}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 65, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0184.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0185.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0186.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0187.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0188.jpg'], 'response': "Based on the provided frames and the question criteria, the answer **'1' (Wash her face, brush her teeth, and comb her hair)** is **not correct** for the question: *“What does the vlogger do in the washroom when she gets up